ial":{"title":"구름 위를 둥둥 떠다니는 Immersive Space 만들기","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS의 "},{"code":"RealityView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"와 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"type":"text","text":"를 이용해, 사용자가 하늘 위 구름 사이를"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"떠다니는 것 같은 몰입형 공간을 처음부터 끝까지 만들어 봅니다. 상태 모델 설계부터","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"에셋 추가와 비동기 프리로딩, 3D 콘텐츠 배치와 애니메이션, 그리고 UI 전환 로직까지","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"실제 프로젝트 코드를 단계별로 따라가며 학습합니다. 시작 전에는 ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"프로젝트와 에셋"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"준비하기"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":"에서 제공 파일을 내려받아 Xcode 프로젝트에 연결합니다.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial","kind":"overview","role":"overview"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter3-ImmersiveView#%ED%95%98%EB%8A%98-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"캐싱해둔 하늘과 구름 템플릿을 실제 3D 공간에 배치할 차례입니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"text":"를","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"사용해 사용자를 감싸는 하늘 스피어를 만들고, 구름들을 무작위로 흩뿌린 뒤","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"자연스럽게 위아래로 떠다니는 애니메이션까지 더해봅니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"section","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter3-immersiveview#%ED%95%98%EB%8A%98-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"하늘 스피어와 구름 배치하기","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter3-ImmersiveView#%ED%95%98%EB%8A%98-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},"ImmersiveView-04.swift":{"highlights":[],"type":"file","fileType":"swift","fileName":"ImmersiveView.swift","content":["\/\/","\/\/  ImmersiveView.swift","\/\/  OvertheCloud","\/\/","","import SwiftUI","import RealityKit","","struct ImmersiveView: View {","    @Environment(AppModel.self) private var appModel","","    private let cloudCount = 8","","    var body: some View {","        RealityView { content in","            let cache = SkyAssetCache.shared","","            guard let skyTemplate = cache.skyEntityTemplate,","                  let cloudA = cache.cloudATemplate,","                  let cloudB = cache.cloudBTemplate else { return }","","            content.add(skyTemplate.clone(recursive: true))","","            for _ in 0..<cloudCount {","                let cloudEntity = Bool.random() ? cloudA.clone(recursive: true) : cloudB.clone(recursive: true)","","                let randomScale = Float.random(in: 10.0...20.0)","                cloudEntity.scale = SIMD3<Float>(repeating: randomScale)","","                let randomAngle = Float.random(in: 0...(2 * .pi))","                cloudEntity.orientation = simd_quatf(angle: randomAngle, axis: SIMD3<Float>(0, 1, 0))","","                let randomPosition = SIMD3<Float>(","                    Float.random(in: -20.0...20.0),","                    Float.random(in: -2.0...(-1.5)),","                    Float.random(in: -20.0...20.0)","                )","                cloudEntity.position = randomPosition","","                content.add(cloudEntity)","            }","        }","    }","","    \/\/\/ 크기와 회전 값을 보존하면서 위아래로만 움직이는 애니메이션","    private func addFloatingAnimation(to entity: Entity, deltaY: Float, duration: Double) {","        let startTransform = entity.transform","        var endTransform = entity.transform","","        endTransform.translation.y += deltaY","","        let floatAnimation = FromToByAnimation<Transform>(","            from: startTransform,","            to: endTransform,","            duration: duration,","            timing: .easeInOut,","            bindTarget: .transform,","            repeatMode: .autoReverse","        )","","        if let animationResource = try? AnimationResource.generate(with: floatAnimation) {","            entity.playAnimation(animationResource)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","identifier":"ImmersiveView-04.swift"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter0-Setup#%ED%85%8D%EC%8A%A4%EC%B2%98%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-Xcode%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"title":"텍스처와 구름 패키지를 Xcode에 연결하기","type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter0-Setup#%ED%85%8D%EC%8A%A4%EC%B2%98%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-Xcode%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"이 튜토리얼은 앱 번들의 하늘 텍스처와 로컬 Swift 패키지의 구름 모델을 사용합니다."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"아래 "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Project files"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"에서 "},{"code":"OvertheCloud-Assets.zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"을 내려받고 압축을 푼 뒤,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"두 종류의 에셋을 각각 앱 타깃과 패키지 의존성에 연결합니다.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter0-setup#%ED%85%8D%EC%8A%A4%EC%B2%98%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-Xcode%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/3.---------------":{"title":"3. 몰입 공간 콘텐츠 구성하기","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/3.---------------","abstract":[],"url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/3.---------------","kind":"article","role":"article"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter5-OvertheCloudApp#WindowGroup%EA%B3%BC-ImmersiveSpace-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"type":"section","abstract":[{"text":"마지막으로 지금까지 만든 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppModel"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveView"},{"text":"를 하나의","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"앱으로 연결합니다. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"text":"과 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"text":"를 Scene으로 등록하고,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"완전 몰입(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"full"},{"text":") 스타일을 지정합니다.","type":"text"}],"kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter5-overthecloudapp#WindowGroup%EA%B3%BC-ImmersiveSpace-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"WindowGroup과 ImmersiveSpace 등록하기","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter5-OvertheCloudApp#WindowGroup%EA%B3%BC-ImmersiveSpace-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter3-ImmersiveView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"캐싱해둔 하늘과 구름 템플릿을 실제 3D 공간에 배치할 차례입니다. "},{"code":"RealityView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"를"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"사용해 사용자를 감싸는 하늘 스피어를 만들고, 구름들을 무작위로 흩뿌린 뒤"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"자연스럽게 위아래로 떠다니는 애니메이션까지 더해봅니다."}],"type":"topic","kind":"project","role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter3-immersiveview","title":"몰입 공간 콘텐츠 구성하기","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter3-ImmersiveView","estimatedTime":"20min"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter2-SkyAssetCache#async-let%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A6%AC%EC%86%8C%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"title":"async let으로 리소스 동시 로딩하기","type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter2-SkyAssetCa